Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.31,0:00:08.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So how was Joan?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.31,0:00:08.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}琼安好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.71,0:00:09.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Broke up with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.71,0:00:09.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟她分手了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.79,0:00:11.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.79,0:00:11.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.07,0:00:13.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't tell me. Because of the big nostril thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.07,0:00:13.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别告诉我  是因为鼻孔太大
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.11,0:00:16.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They were huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.11,0:00:16.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的超大
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.79,0:00:20.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When she sneezed, bats flew out of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.79,0:00:20.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她打喷嚏时  会有蝙蝠飞出来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.23,0:00:23.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on! They were not that huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.23,0:00:23.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哪有那么夸张
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.33,0:00:26.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm telling you, she leaned back, I could see her brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.33,0:00:26.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当她仰起头时  我可以看到她的脑子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.94,0:00:30.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How many perfectly fine women are you gonna reject...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.94,0:00:30.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你到底要因为非常肤浅的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.32,0:00:32.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...over the most superficial insignificant things?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.32,0:00:32.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拒绝多少好女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.94,0:00:35.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hold it. I gotta side with Chandler on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.94,0:00:35.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}慢着  我必须帮钱德勒说话
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.91,0:00:38.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When I first moved here, I went out a couple of times with this girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.91,0:00:38.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我刚搬到这里时  和一个女孩交往
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.75,0:00:40.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really hot. Great kisser...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.75,0:00:40.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她性感火辣  很会接吻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.59,0:00:43.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but she had the biggest Adam's apple.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.59,0:00:43.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是她的喉结大得出奇
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.59,0:00:46.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Drove me nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.59,0:00:46.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真让我受不了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.28,0:00:50.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You or me? - I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.28,0:00:50.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你说还是我说  -我来好了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.13,0:00:54.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Joey, women don't have Adam's apples.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.13,0:00:54.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊  女人没有喉结
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.29,0:01:03.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You guys are messing with me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.29,0:01:03.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们在骗我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.44,0:01:07.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. We are!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.44,0:01:07.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  我们在骗你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.58,0:01:11.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's a good one. For a second there, I was like, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.58,0:01:11.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真好笑  我差点上当了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.34,0:01:15.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《老友记》第二季第三集  哈克先生之死
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.19,0:02:05.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You name one woman that you broke up with for an actual real reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.19,0:02:05.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你和哪个女友分手是因为正当的理由
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.58,0:02:07.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maureen Rasillo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.58,0:02:07.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莫琳·罗西洛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.90,0:02:10.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because she doesn't hate Yanni is not a real reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.90,0:02:10.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她不讨厌雅尼  这算不上正当理由
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.90,0:02:10.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}雅尼  当今世界著名的新世纪音乐作曲家和演奏家
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.03,0:02:17.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello, Mr. Heckles.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.03,0:02:17.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好  哈克先生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.64,0:02:19.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're doing it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.64,0:02:19.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.30,0:02:21.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're not doing anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.30,0:02:21.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们什么都没做
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.54,0:02:24.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're stomping. It's disturbing my birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.54,0:02:24.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们脚步声太响  吓到了我的鸟儿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.54,0:02:28.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't have birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.54,0:02:28.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你没有养鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.52,0:02:30.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I could have birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.52,0:02:30.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可以养鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.48,0:02:34.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ok, Mr. Heckles, we'll try to keep it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.48,0:02:34.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  哈克先生  我们会小声一点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.46,0:02:35.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.46,0:02:35.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.03,0:02:37.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm going to rejoin my dinner party.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.03,0:02:37.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要回去继续宴客了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.49,0:02:40.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.49,0:02:40.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好  再见
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.89,0:02:44.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ok, Janice. Janice. 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.89,0:02:44.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对了  珍妮丝  珍妮丝
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.66,0:02:46.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You gotta give me Janice.  That wasn't about being picky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.66,0:02:46.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们想想珍妮丝  就知道我没吹毛求疵了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.88,0:02:48.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We'll give you Janice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.88,0:02:48.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}和她分手倒不是因为挑剔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.52,0:02:49.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I miss Janice, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.52,0:02:49.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我蛮想珍妮丝的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.79,0:02:52.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello, Chandler Bing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.79,0:02:52.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}钱德勒·宾
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.11,0:02:58.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.11,0:02:58.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.05,0:03:00.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, Chandler!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.05,0:03:00.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}钱德勒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.75,0:03:03.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.75,0:03:03.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在就要
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.55,0:03:06.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.55,0:03:06.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.24,0:03:09.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There! Faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.24,0:03:09.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快  快点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.03,0:03:19.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Stop with the broom! We're not making noise!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.03,0:03:19.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别用扫把敲了  我们没有制造噪音
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.67,0:03:31.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We won.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.67,0:03:31.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.96,0:03:32.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.96,0:03:32.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们胜利了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.80,0:03:38.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mr. Heckles!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.80,0:03:38.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哈克先生
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.16,0:03:44.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- How did this happen? -  He musta been sweepin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.16,0:03:44.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-怎么发生的  -他大概在扫地
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.26,0:03:46.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They found a broom in his hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.26,0:03:46.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们发现他抓着一把扫把
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.57,0:03:52.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- That's terrible. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.57,0:03:52.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-真糟糕  -我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.65,0:03:53.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was sweeping yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.65,0:03:53.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}昨天我也在扫地
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.82,0:03:56.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It could've been me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.82,0:03:56.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}搞不好也会一命呜呼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.46,0:04:00.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sweeping. You never know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.46,0:04:00.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}扫地  真是天有不测风云
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.66,0:04:01.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Never know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.66,0:04:01.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}世事难料
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.09,0:04:09.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's very faint, but I can still sense him in the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.09,0:04:09.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很微弱  但我还可以感觉他在大楼里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.88,0:04:13.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Go into the light, Mr. Heckles!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.88,0:04:13.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现身吧  哈克先生
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.15,0:04:18.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.15,0:04:18.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了  菲比
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.28,0:04:21.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry, but sometimes they need help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.28,0:04:21.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起  有时候他们需要帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.94,0:04:24.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.94,0:04:24.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.11,0:04:27.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's fine, go ahead and scoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.11,0:04:27.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很好  嘲笑我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.42,0:04:30.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There are a lot of things I don't believe in...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.42,0:04:30.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不相信很多事情
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.42,0:04:32.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}... but that doesn't mean they're not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.42,0:04:32.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但这不表示就不是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.79,0:04:33.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Such as?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.79,0:04:33.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}比如呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.26,0:04:39.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Like crop circles or the Bermuda Triangle or evolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.26,0:04:39.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}像是麦田怪圈或百慕达三角  或进化论
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.64,0:04:45.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What, you don't believe in evolution?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.64,0:04:45.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不相信进化论
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.16,0:04:46.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nah. Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.16,0:04:46.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不太相信
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.08,0:04:50.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't believe in evolution?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.08,0:04:50.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不相信进化论
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.13,0:04:52.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know. It's just, you know....
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.13,0:04:52.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道...  只是...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.42,0:04:58.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Monkeys, Darwin, it's a nice story. I just think it's a little too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.42,0:04:58.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}猴子  达尔文  故事不错  只是有点太简单
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.69,0:05:03.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Too easy"? Too...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.69,0:05:03.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}"太简单"  太...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.71,0:05:08.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The process of every living thing on this planet evolving...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.71,0:05:08.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个星球上的一切生物  经过数千万年
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.19,0:05:12.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...over millions of years from single-celled organisms is "too easy"?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.19,0:05:12.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}从单细胞微生物进化而来的过程  你说太简单
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.48,0:05:14.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I just don't buy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.48,0:05:14.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  我不太相信
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.42,0:05:20.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me. Evolution is not for you to buy, Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.42,0:05:20.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起  进化论不是让你去相信的  菲比
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.80,0:05:24.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Evolution is scientific fact, like the air we breathe...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.80,0:05:24.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}进化论是科学事实  就像我们呼吸的空气
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.81,0:05:26.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...like gravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.81,0:05:26.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就像地心引力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.18,0:05:28.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't get me started on gravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.18,0:05:28.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别让我跟你争论地心引力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.91,0:05:35.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't believe in gravity?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.91,0:05:35.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不相信地心引力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.24,0:05:40.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, it's not so much that, you know, I don't believe in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.24,0:05:40.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}倒不是相不相信的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.28,0:05:43.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}you know, it's just...I don't know, lately I get the feeling that
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.28,0:05:43.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}最近我感觉到
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.83,0:05:47.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I'm not so much being pulled down as I am being pushed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.83,0:05:47.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不是被吸住  而是被压着
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.11,0:05:48.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Pushed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.11,0:05:48.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}被压着
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.69,0:05:52.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's Isaac Newton and he's pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.69,0:05:52.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是艾萨克·牛顿  他生气了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.08,0:05:59.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There she is. And over there, that's the other one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.08,0:05:59.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她在那边  另一个在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.43,0:06:01.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is Mr. Buddy Doyle, Heckles' attorney.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.43,0:06:01.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是伯弟·杜尔  哈克的律师
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.93,0:06:03.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He'd like to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.93,0:06:03.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他想跟你们谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.48,0:06:04.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What can we do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.48,0:06:04.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有何贵干
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.68,0:06:06.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, kids, here's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.68,0:06:06.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了  孩子们  事情是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.15,0:06:08.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}According my client's will...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.15,0:06:08.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}根据我客户的遗嘱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.98,0:06:12.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}... he wants to leave all his earthly possessions...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.98,0:06:12.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他要把他所有财产
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.31,0:06:17.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to "the noisy girls in the apartment above mine."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.31,0:06:17.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}都留给"楼上吵闹的女孩们"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.43,0:06:20.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What about his family?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.43,0:06:20.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他的家人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.79,0:06:21.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He didn't have any.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.79,0:06:21.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他没有家人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.35,0:06:25.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, so let's talk money.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.35,0:06:25.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好  让我们看看有多少钱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.17,0:06:29.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, there was none.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.17,0:06:29.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好  没有半毛钱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.87,0:06:31.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, let's talk signing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.87,0:06:31.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在  我们来签字
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.90,0:06:34.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You be noisy girl number one. You be noisy girl number two.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.90,0:06:34.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是一号吵闹女孩  你是二号吵闹女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.70,0:06:39.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't believe that this whole time we thought he hated us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.70,0:06:39.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真不相信  我们一直以为他讨厌我们
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.95,0:06:43.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Isn't it amazing how much you can touch someone's life...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.95,0:06:43.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真是不可思议  我们能如此感动其他人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.82,0:06:45.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...without even knowing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.82,0:06:45.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而自己却不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.72,0:06:47.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Would you look at this dump?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.72,0:06:47.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看看这个猪窝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.84,0:06:50.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He hated us! This was his final revenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.84,0:06:50.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他痛恨我们  这是他最终的报复
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.27,0:06:52.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've never seen so much crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.27,0:06:52.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我从来没看过这么多废物
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.41,0:06:55.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Actually, I think this apartment sullies the good name of crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.41,0:06:55.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得这间公寓侮辱了废物的美名
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.28,0:06:58.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.28,0:06:58.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.79,0:07:01.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can I have this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.79,0:07:01.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个能给我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.78,0:07:05.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How can you not believe in evolution?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.78,0:07:05.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你怎么能不相信进化论
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.55,0:07:10.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know, just don't. Look at this funky shirt!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.55,0:07:10.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道  就是不相信  看看这条怪衬衫
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.36,0:07:14.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Pheebs, I've studied evolution my entire adult life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.36,0:07:14.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比  我长大后都在研究进化论
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.27,0:07:17.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ok, I can tell you, we have collected fossils from all over the world...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.27,0:07:17.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们从世界各地搜集化石
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.92,0:07:21.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that actually show the evolution of different species.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.92,0:07:21.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}能够证明不同物种的进化论
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.65,0:07:24.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, you can literally see them...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.65,0:07:24.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可以确确实实看到它们
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.74,0:07:27.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...evolving through time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.74,0:07:27.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}随着时间进化
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.42,0:07:31.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? You can actually see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.42,0:07:31.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的  可以看得到
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.87,0:07:36.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You bet! In the U.S., China, Africa, all over!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.87,0:07:36.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}千真万确  在美国  中国  非洲  全世界
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.04,0:07:38.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See, I didn't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.04,0:07:38.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.51,0:07:40.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, there you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.51,0:07:40.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在知道了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.28,0:07:48.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So now the real question is, who put those fossils there and why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.28,0:07:48.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以实际问题是  谁把化石放在那里  为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.34,0:07:55.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look at this! My Big Book of Grievances.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.34,0:07:55.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看看这个  《我的苦水宝典》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.49,0:07:59.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, there's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.49,0:07:59.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.79,0:08:03.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"April 17th, excessive noise...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.79,0:08:03.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}"四月十七日  噪音过度"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.80,0:08:05.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}... Italian guy comes home with a date."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.80,0:08:05.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}"意大利佬带了女伴回家"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.52,0:08:09.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey Chandler, look, you're in here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.52,0:08:09.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}钱德勒  你也在里面
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.34,0:08:11.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"April 18th, excessive noise...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.34,0:08:11.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}"四月十八日  噪音过度"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.99,0:08:14.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}... Italian guy's gay roommate brings home dry cleaning."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.99,0:08:14.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}"意大利佬的同性恋室友带了干洗衣服回家"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.67,0:08:23.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, that's excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.67,0:08:23.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.65,0:08:27.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Monica, Monica, look at this lamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.65,0:08:27.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莫妮卡  莫妮卡  看看这盏灯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.38,0:08:29.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is this tacky or what? We have to have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.38,0:08:29.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真是够俗了  我们一定要带回去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.81,0:08:33.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Rache, I think we have enough regular lamps.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.81,0:08:33.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋  我们的好台灯够多了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.49,0:08:35.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? Come on, it's not like...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.49,0:08:35.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么  别这样  我又不是...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.99,0:08:38.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}... I'm asking for this girlie clock or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.99,0:08:38.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要这个美女时钟或什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.55,0:08:40.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Which, by the way, I also think is really cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.55,0:08:40.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我觉得这个也很酷
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.27,0:08:44.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, it doesn't go with any of my stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.27,0:08:44.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着  它与我的东西都不搭配
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.94,0:08:48.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, what about my stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.94,0:08:48.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那么我的东西呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.58,0:08:49.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't have any stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.58,0:08:49.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你没有任何东西
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.33,0:08:53.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You still think of it as your apartment, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.33,0:08:53.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还是认为那是你的公寓  对不对
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.14,0:08:57.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- No. - Yes, you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.14,0:08:57.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不  -你就是这么想的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.42,0:09:00.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You think of it as your apartment and I just someone who rent a room.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.42,0:09:00.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你觉得那是你的公寓  我只是租客而已
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.95,0:09:07.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}While you "mmm" on that for a while,and I'll go find a place for my new lamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.95,0:09:07.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你支支吾吾的时候  我为我的新台灯找个地方放
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.05,0:09:14.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, Pheebs. See how I'm making these little toys move?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.05,0:09:14.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比  看我玩这些小玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.80,0:09:19.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Opposable thumbs!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.80,0:09:19.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对生拇指
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.80,0:09:24.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Without evolution, how do you explain opposable thumbs?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.80,0:09:24.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有进化论  怎么会有对生拇指
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.31,0:09:29.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe the Overlords needed them to steer their spacecrafts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.31,0:09:29.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也许外星主宰需要拇指  才能够驾驶飞碟
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.62,0:09:32.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Please tell me you're joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.62,0:09:32.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请说你是在开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.22,0:09:37.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, can't we say that you believe in something and I don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.22,0:09:37.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}能不能承认  你相信进化论  而我不相信
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.36,0:09:39.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, Pheebs, we can't. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.36,0:09:39.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行  菲比  不能这样  好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.28,0:09:39.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.28,0:09:39.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么不行
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.87,0:09:43.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What is this obsessive need you have to make everybody agree with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.87,0:09:43.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么非得每个人都同意你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.08,0:09:45.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what I think?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.08,0:09:45.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道我怎么想吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.50,0:09:51.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think maybe it's time you put Ross under the microscope.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.50,0:09:51.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想你也许应该好好检视一下罗斯这个生物了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.74,0:09:58.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is there blood coming out of my ears?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.74,0:09:58.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我耳朵有没有流血
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.76,0:10:03.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Check it out. Heckles' high-school yearbook.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.76,0:10:03.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看看这个  哈克的高中年鉴
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.51,0:10:06.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He looks so normal!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.51,0:10:06.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他看起来好正常
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.33,0:10:08.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's even kind of cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.33,0:10:08.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}甚至有点可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.32,0:10:11.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Heckles, you crack me up in science class.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.32,0:10:11.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}"哈克  你上科学课总是让我捧腹大笑"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.66,0:10:13.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're the funniest kid in school."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.66,0:10:13.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}"你是全校最有趣的学生"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.16,0:10:16.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Funniest? Heckles? - That's what it says.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.16,0:10:16.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-最有趣  哈克  -上面是这样写的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.61,0:10:20.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Heckles was voted class clown, and so was I.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.61,0:10:20.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哈克被选为班上的活宝  我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.88,0:10:24.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He was right! Would you listen to that?
