Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.46,0:20:24.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她又漂亮又聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.22,0:20:27.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I've been holding off asking her out in the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.22,0:20:27.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我一直没有约她出来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.07,0:20:31.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}because she has a unusually large head.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.07,0:20:31.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为她的头超级大
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.02,0:20:35.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But I'm not going to let that stuff hang me up anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.02,0:20:35.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我不想让这种事情牵绊我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.89,0:20:38.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look at me. I'm growing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.89,0:20:38.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看看我  我成熟了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.98,0:20:42.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can't recycle yearbooks, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.98,0:20:42.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}年鉴能不能回收利用
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.62,0:20:44.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll take that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.62,0:20:44.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.04,0:20:46.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You want his yearbook?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.04,0:20:46.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要他的年鉴
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.39,0:20:50.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah,yeah. Some people said nice things about him. Think somebody should have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.39,0:20:50.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有人说了他的好话  应该留下来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.77,0:20:52.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Gosh, this is so weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.77,0:20:52.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这真的很奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.81,0:20:57.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}His whole life was in this apartment and now it's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.81,0:20:57.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他一生都在这公寓度过  现在人去楼空
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.20,0:21:02.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think it would be nice if we just took a few moments for Mr. Heckles.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.20,0:21:02.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想我们应该为哈克先生默哀一会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.93,0:21:07.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He was kind of a pain. He was, but he was a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.93,0:21:07.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他是个麻烦人物  但他也是个人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.36,0:21:15.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're all going to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.36,0:21:15.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们全都会下地狱
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.16,0:21:17.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's really not that big!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.16,0:21:17.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}其实没有那么大
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.55,0:21:23.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Taking that with you, huh? - Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.55,0:21:23.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你要拿那个走  -没错
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.28,0:21:31.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.28,0:21:31.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}走吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.28,0:21:33.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah.In a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.28,0:21:33.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}走  等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.68,0:21:50.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Goodbye, Mr. Heckles.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.68,0:21:50.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再见  哈克先生
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.01,0:21:56.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We'll try to keep it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.01,0:21:56.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们会安静点
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.96,0:22:09.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my major was totally useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.96,0:22:09.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我完全学非所用
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.92,0:22:13.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How often do you look in the classifieds and see "Philosopher Wanted"?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.92,0:22:13.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}报纸上什么时候看得到"招聘哲学家"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.11,0:22:15.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.11,0:22:15.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.68,0:22:17.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My God, that's a big head!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.68,0:22:17.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊  头可真大
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.93,0:22:23.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It didn't look this big in the office. Maybe it's the lighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.93,0:22:23.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在办公室看起来没这么大  也许是灯光原因
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.95,0:22:26.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My head must look like a golf ball at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.95,0:22:26.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的头在公司一定像高尔夫球那么小
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.22,0:22:32.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't get hung up on it. Quick! List five things you like about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.22,0:22:32.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不要想了  快列出你喜欢她的五件事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.26,0:22:34.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nice smile, good dresser.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.26,0:22:34.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}笑容甜美  衣着得体
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.43,0:22:36.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Big head, big head, big head!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.43,0:22:36.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大头  大头  还是大头
